  2051	            # P1-2: the verifier could not produce a usable verdict (execution
  2052	            # error / empty / the driven verify failed). This must NOT fall through
  2053	            # to a clean finish — on the build/web surface a FINISH requires a real
  2054	            # PASS verdict (W-32: route completion THROUGH the gate). Refuse-and-
  2055	            # continue (bounded), then an EXPLICIT unverified release at the cap;
  2056	            # never a silent done, never a fall-back to the legacy browser gate.
