Implemented REL-1e flag-gated promotion.

Summary:
- Added `DISCO_HOST_VERIFY_AUTHORITATIVE` via `disco_env`, default off.
- Host verifier becomes authoritative only when enabled: pass proceeds, fail refuses with a loud system reminder and bounded `unverified_release`.
- Browser inline self-verify delegates/skips when host authoritative verification is available.
- Prompt self-verify mandate is softened only when the flag is enabled.
- Non-app/files handoffs without a validator record `verdict="unverifiable"` and `verified=false`.
- Added focused REL-1e tests plus manifest-stamp coverage.

